      "id": 486621,
      "username": "furkanayyildiz",
      "name": "Furkan Ayyıldız",
      "created_at": "2025-11-16T18:45:50.258Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello, I’m new to ERPNext and I have a question.</p>\n<p>When I try to generate a report in the general accounting section, it only shows sales invoices and payment entries. What I actually need is a more detailed report — one that lists every product sold along with every payment entry related to it. In short, I want to combine the product-wise sales records with the payment entry records and display them as a single report. Is it possible to do this?</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/f0a364/{size}.png",
      "trust_level": 1,
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
