      "name": "volkswagner",
      "created_at": "2025-11-17T02:37:27.072Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The combination of criteria seems odd to me. Can you further expat your use case?</p>\n<p>Are you interested in the payment entry or the price/amount the item sold for?</p>\n<p>You can build nearly any report you can think of using query report or script report.</p>",
