    {
      "id": 486647,
      "username": "Pawan",
      "name": "Pawan",
      "created_at": "2025-11-17T08:14:16.740Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Earlier versions used to have Paid Amount column in Sales Invoice but am not very sure if that is still relevant in newer versions <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/slight_smile.png?v=14\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> .</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/f/af904e4818cee557eda3e4c5d640b5f5b3cefe92.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/af904e4818cee557eda3e4c5d640b5f5b3cefe92\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-11-17 at 1.37.02 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/f/af904e4818cee557eda3e4c5d640b5f5b3cefe92_2_470x500.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-11-17 at 1.37.02 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"p36JkajyIPz8HbPcyL4bkO8qIRs\" width=\"470\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/f/af904e4818cee557eda3e4c5d640b5f5b3cefe92_2_470x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/f/af904e4818cee557eda3e4c5d640b5f5b3cefe92_2_705x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/f/af904e4818cee557eda3e4c5d640b5f5b3cefe92_2_940x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F7F7F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-11-17 at 1.37.02 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">1104×1172 111 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Another possible work around is using the <code>Accounts &gt; Process Statement of Accounts</code> functionality to generate and send Statement of Account to your customer(s)</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/pawan/{size}/56341_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 5,
